  "https://abcnews.com/US/doj-refuses-issue-signed-declaration-verifying-anti-weaponization/story?id=134040412",
  "https://abcnews.com/Health/wireStory/africa-cdc-chief-continent-invest-funds-ebola-response-134043400",
  "https://abcnews.com/US/wireStory/us-gas-prices-dip-below-4-time-march-133994593",
  "https://abcnews.com/US/78-world-cup-matches-counter-drone-technology-white/story?id=133927808"
)

